              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "50.6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Guyyaani gabaabate jennaani ilma ufii Yusufu yaame waan jed'eeni, Harka kanke jiddu gudeeda kiyya keeyad'i, aka lafa Misiri keesati na inawaalle kakhad'i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fulla abbooti tiyya iti awaalaniti nale awaali; lafa Misiri tana keesaa na fuud'i, fulla worra iti awaalaniti na awaali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yusufuuni waan jed'eeni, Ee, iti kakhad'a. Yusufuuni iti kakhate jennaani Yakobooni galata Waaqaa deebise gach'iise.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
